A local extern declares GfGfxLoader_LoadCharData void; the definition
(gf_gfx_loader.c:8) returns u32. Harmless on ARM, a trapping
signature-mismatch call on wasm. The declaration takes the real return type.

The digital watch's backlight-on branch calls ov11_02252DB4, a battle
overlay label; on hardware 0x02252DB4 is ov20_02252DB4 (the resident
Poketch overlay's backlight palette load, ov20_02252C5C.s), and on wasm the
ov11 code ran instead (a wild Heap_Free, SIGBUS, on a tap on the watch
screen). The call names the function the address holds; the (0, 0)
arguments stay so the ARM build is unchanged.

